      "description": "The phrase 'jew mad?' is a derogatory stereotype implying Jewish people are irrational, hysterical, or emotionally unstable. This is a common antisemitic trope used to dehumanize Jews by suggesting they are prone to irrational anger or behavior, which is historically rooted in antisemitic propaganda.",
