      "instance_name": "adolf_hitler_context",
      "label": "Historical Figure: Adolf Hitler",
      "description": "Adolf Hitler was the dictator of Nazi Germany and the architect of the Holocaust, responsible for the genocide of six million Jews and millions of others. His image and association with Nazi ideology are central to understanding the meme's hateful content, as it uses his presence to invoke historical atrocities and dehumanize Jewish people.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
