      "label": "hateful and provocative emotion",
      "description": "The overall emotion expressed by the meme is hateful and provocative, designed to incite anger or mockery toward Jewish people by using Nazi imagery and antisemitic stereotypes. The text 'jew mad?' and 'get fuhrererious!' are emotionally charged phrases that mock and dehumanize Jews, invoking historical atrocities and promoting hate. The visual of Hitler and Nazi officials in a parade, combined with the text, creates a confrontational and offensive emotional tone.",
